    "sentence_translations": [
      "Chapter 18: I’m Sorry",
      "",
      "Gao Hong told Little Tian that she didn’t let Lele meet up with him.",
      "This was because she wanted Lele and Little Tian to study hard first and wait until they got into college to meet up.",
      "",
      "Little Tian asked Gao Hong, “So you went to the train station to meet up with me? And told me that you were Lele?”",
      "",
      "“Yes, Little Tian. At that time, I wanted you and Lele to study hard.",
      "Now that you and Lele have both gotten into a good college, you can meet up now. I also want to apologize to you,” Gao Hong said.",
      "",
      "Little Tian understood everything now. He looked at Lele and also at his dad.",
      "He asked Gao Hong, “Then how did you and my dad meet?”",
      "",
      "Dad smiled and said, “It was your teacher who introduced us.”",
      "",
      "“Teacher? When did this happen? How come I didn’t know about this?” Little Tian asked."
    ]
  }
